// Chapter 6: a palette. A palette of our own, drawn for this book. Same numbers and same names as the Commodore 64 one.
// One color on each line: two hexadecimal digits for red, two for green, two for blue.
16202A    //  0: black
F4F1E8    //  1: white
D9483B    //  2: red
3FB8AF    //  3: cyan
7C5CBF    //  4: purple
5BA84A    //  5: green
2F6DB5    //  6: blue
F2C94C    //  7: yellow
E8891C    //  8: orange
7A4B2A    //  9: brown
F08A7B    // 10: light red
3A4753    // 11: dark gray
7B8794    // 12: gray
A8D672    // 13: light green
7DB7E8    // 14: light blue
C5CED6    // 15: light gray
